# @airing-cal/web-worker — local secrets (never commit real values)
# Production: `pnpm exec wrangler secret put THUMB_GEN_BEARER --name airing-cal-frontend`
# Must match node-jobs / GitHub Actions writer `AIRINGCAL_THUMB_GEN_BEARER`.

THUMB_GEN_BEARER=

# Documented cover thumb format (R2 key suffix `thumb.v1.webp`; transform fixed in thumb-gen.ts).
# Not a runtime Worker var today — bump only when shipping a new thumb key / transform revision.
THUMB_SPEC_REVISION=v1

# v3 read parity (#147 C7) — optional, default is the legacy phase-0 read path.
# AIRINGCAL_READ_MODE=v3-release serves /api/* + /image/* from the shared public
# Release (needs the AIRINGCAL_PUBLIC_R2 binding, see docs/v3/cloudflare-read-worker.md).
# AIRINGCAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL must be an absolute https CDN base; placeholders are
# rejected (503 INVALID_READ_CONFIG) when the v3-release mode is enabled.
AIRINGCAL_READ_MODE=
AIRINGCAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
